!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = RPMI 1640 with L-glutamine (Corning, MT10040CM) supplemented with 10% (BCBL-1) or 20% (BC-2) Serum Plus-II (Sigma-Aldrich, catalog number 14009C, lots 15H243 and 21C421), 10 µg/mL gentamycin (ThermoFisher, 15710064) and 0.05 mM β-mercaptoethanol (Sigma-Aldrich, M3148-25ML).
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Genomic DNA was extracted from frozen pellets following a salt-precipitation protocol outlined in Manzano et al, Nat Comm 2018.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = For HiSeq4000 runs, a two-step PCR protocol was used for the amplification Brunello lentiGuide inserts before adding Illumina adapters and sample barcodes, as as outlined previously (Manzano et al., Nat Comm 2018). For NextSeq 500 runs, a single PCR was performed to simultaneously amplify lentiGuide inserts, add Illumina adapters, and barcode samples.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = OTHER: CRISPR guide amplicon sequencing
!Sample_description = BCBL1 sgAAVS1 Control
!Sample_data_processing = Concatenation of samples (BCBL1 shRNA) repeated on HiSeq4000 and NextSeq500
!Sample_data_processing = Adapter trimming with Cutadapt v4.1
